      <title>Hugging Face报告：2026年开源模型发布最多的是芯片公司</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/gpt/post/20260904/Hugging-Face%E6%8A%A5%E5%91%8A2026%E5%B9%B4%E5%BC%80%E6%BA%90%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E5%8F%91%E5%B8%83%E6%9C%80%E5%A4%9A%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF%E8%8A%AF%E7%89%87%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8/</link>
